#: scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb8dfbedb24c3329f4902c935b266b4222ae5bdd5f7d49256109d60a767cc1b9
#. default-sha256: be2218acf7eb29a25b43ecdd84f145562bee7320dacca589b0692df58bb7e57e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A2E216FA_4C95_43F9_B3F6_A9DC168A11F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Approximately a week had passed since then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그로부터 ⟪k:3⟫일주일이 지났습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57ee570679773336d083bd68b79f572bbb9dc9fbcdb53bb7d80b2fde161af456
#. default-sha256: c6942062c1cdc9b3f9d32b687a9a85d49204c410a690e5bf8696f6514bbfde5c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CAFDA7DB_FB10_4C06_B482_922B43D1B95E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl was, as usual, spending her time in her room reading, staying inside "
"the house. ⟪k:1⟫Then, Maria barged in."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫다른 날처럼 외출하지 않고, ⟪k:1⟫방에서 책을 읽으며 지내던 소녀에게 ⟪k:2⟫마리아가 헐레벌떡 찾"
"아왔습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 720c792021ecab31732d147007265976c6441c679522e278df2efa334df8941a
#. default-sha256: 0c74a6abc017e08fa7960db50390534acfe0318ae3c9ecb26505ca86b874d32b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4FA7383C_DECE_4819_A7A8_B98BAFCD2BA8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Madam! ⟪k:4⟫Madam!⟪k:5⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마님――, ⟪k:4⟫마님!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38b4579b7c461871abda331125e6d16172141e328de5968e6216862ff743560b
#. default-sha256: df6012004d7b91539af1999aff5333c09767a8956abc2f399972abaf1308c579
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C05CAF9C_E7FB_4252_8F73_93B193AC5AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh my. You’re out of breath. What happened?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫어머……, ⟪k:8⟫무슨 일이세요? ⟪k:9⟫그렇게 급하게."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a52fc38270733b690e54af2c3ea9d3ac3bcfdc2f56aece7b290d4b037eb8642
#. default-sha256: 457f997b51aecd287c67b9b03bfad2c7faba52320063b145291881d33bd22c33
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C8DD4FDD_FA29_4704_BD2E_EE0F0369819F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“What happened” is we have a ⟪k:2⟫big problem⟪k:3⟫!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Th-⟪k:6⟫The garden... ⟪k:7⟫"
"The rose garden!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫무슨 일이긴! ⟪k:2⟫큰일났어!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫자, ⟪k:5⟫장미 정원이……, ⟪k:6⟫장미 정원이!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fafdafa6e7de30fd9861f5e04ed56bc6f22ad175586ac5e98c0c74cfb4aaf264
#. default-sha256: e631ecb60fc6b1fff14e49373159e44bbed84cfa44240a1a72a44740fd8f05ad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3DCD861F_058E_40BE_AE8A_3310153AA948"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The garden...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫장미 정원이……?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fa88eddb7efa0bd1c72e991bec53887b86b9c7e0bb6173324cae839fc0219c3
#. default-sha256: 071f4f839a0ee74df8748ad26e4fa5452b7cf87bd3aadef297c2ab0e93e04333
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A65CC86E_007C_44B2_81AA_69D1D601CC5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All the roses you put so much love and care into growing are being chopped down! We’ll "
"lose them all if we don’t hurry!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫마님이 소중히 기르던 장미가 ⟪k:2⟫싹 밀리려고 해!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫이대로 두면 ⟪k:5⟫다 사라질 거"
"야……!!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e418f91aa50adfdde0279d71ca538e0b2e83cd82b69c4c38723314875b8fd492
#. default-sha256: eb4c099d8dd2b4e7c1c6b4943695ca6904bad651092a0e504591d097e3754e3e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C451D8F3_79C5_477C_BD07_33A30387DFC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0e6d773f9a788d99867bdd2b309163556378471c8b341451e95899ddb95bdbee
#. default-sha256: 4df7dcb149ac032d9aef836cd4e42299b6e57ec5abbe3018d54be2f4ecf39313
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_53625603_D41C_4F94_BDBB_CA19473AA8F1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Upon hearing the news, the White-Haired Girl dashed from her room and toward "
"the garden, with Maria following close behind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫소녀는 그 소식을 듣고 ⟪k:4⟫황급히 방에서 나와 ⟪k:5⟫장미 정원으로 갔습니다. "
"⟪k:6⟫마리아도 그 뒤를 ⟪k:7⟫따라갔지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 796c4f35f4b888685c1f89f46a72530d60fbec3b53c8151409a1142f8c9fbd59
#. default-sha256: 43896079c882886c7fcf2fa4062db53aa801ae055446732494bd4529e9f9785c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_48F55368_9472_4E29_9F2C_EF5E121ADF2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When she arrived, she saw a dozen or so sweaty, rugged men at work, Jacopo "
"shouting orders."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫장미 정원에 도착해 보니, ⟪k:3⟫많은 남자들에게 ⟪k:4⟫지시를 내리는 야코포가 있었습니"
"다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae38078929dd2e45cd4b7250b86346ca52923110edde8af8ba2f46ea7fc9a620
#. default-sha256: 77368f3601b833f76836c0ae3fc0dfd5fde52a640aef641bc24757d486f2678d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA0374A_0D3A_4740_847F_DA872E153643"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The men clearly had no concept of how much a single flower was worth, no concern whatsoever "
"for their beauty..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫장미의 아름다움도 이해 못 할 ⟪k:1⟫우악스러운 땀범벅 노동자들.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이들은 ⟪k:4⟫장미 한 송"
"이의 가치도 모르고――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fc2f89f3d15d31d0c50f090735b23adc729d59d509e0fa32da40a1a12d4b6b8
#. default-sha256: dc374572ec5e05a2ce55d3ac8f82535df7c7367085f993c11be8226229ae84b5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12875B8E_D8B4_47A3_80A2_186F2DD16547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫for they mercilessly, thoughtlessly hacked away at the shrubs like they were naught but "
"weeds."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫난잡하게, ⟪k:1⟫무자비하게, ⟪k:2⟫잡초라도 베는 것처럼 ⟪k:3⟫마구잡이로 장미를 밀었습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26179aacb263cf14e413ff7d257ccef6176bdae14ec1c60ef3b7b32b288ac0ed
#. default-sha256: 0bca57f9d740aa2ed7fe655a786eb6f51cc7df1adf50f9ff1ed7769c3c434a81
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E6CFDC0C_D817_4D18_99EA_0B6A2BF3C150"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Each flower they tore from the earth extinguished another of the many lives the White-Haired "
"Girl had put so much time and effort into tending for."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫백발 소녀가 ⟪k:1⟫공을 들여 돌보던 꽃의 생명이―― 사라져 갔지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d1a03059a60ff83dc71d7e9ada45f67a10906a939a979aeef9778aae0b68167
#. default-sha256: 2220d5ec65e2a0436a182317e8d419d24c0b8fb3e4528b78053c6eaf42cb9c8b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9B51C402_245E_46EF_B8EF_ED930F083B75"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫J-⟪k:9⟫Jacopo, what are you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫야, ⟪k:9⟫야코포, ⟪k:10⟫너 무슨 짓을――."

#: scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1dc0cab9b26f92d4ce035e90175ff568b4b2c9b4116d170215224af059712c82
#. default-sha256: 5b1133a81ede3995dc66543cbb8e1671de2a3bb3ff0e57cf43a31d9495d704ea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_12CAB4FA_B234_4881_8F80_676ADCF249FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, hello, Maria.⟪k:2⟫I didn’t expect you would come with her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫뭐야, ⟪k:2⟫마리아인가. ⟪k:3⟫너까지 올 줄은 몰랐어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b188aa02cde8d469108338c67c3702ed5537655a4679c3e88ee0f3ff35472168
#. default-sha256: f5526714345ee02fc0e2ecef97cc5d5b3cc9454a261a5c636b768d39e5c6cd63
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_321047B4_09F0_4FA6_9559_0C9EE017413B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why... ⟪k:2⟫would you do..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어째서…… 장미 정원을……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e28181b0942351c56525b1ee72abbe996f41e1985f9755fb5619c1d4b9d1d6a
#. default-sha256: 3bad9d12b5507508070230a858ff204198487e47071243730dec2cc61b2c8020
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15CF168C_7991_4E09_AAD1_452A22D77F03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why? Why, it goes without saying.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫This house has no need of a garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어째서냐고? ⟪k:2⟫그야 ⟪k:3⟫뻔하지.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫――필요 없어서 그래."

#: scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cae6b92b774e79313ec43dce75035ce5ff0487892cd6512fdf047cfb8251f51
#. default-sha256: e4195c5f07dd3398108fae4beef8bfd37642891cf9da40ac7db7f95e0140e063
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_542FEA29_0476_4C94_9B2E_17895E87ADA3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Damn flowers have no place here.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Might as well do something worthwhile with "
"the soil."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이 저택에 꽃은 필요 없어.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫꽃이나 둘 바에는 ⟪k:4⟫땅을 적절하게 활용해야지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1edb36b1a4a8d82d3aac6b74023bcdc1e13bc3323e272fce31228ecca3fb9feb
#. default-sha256: 78bd00fc4dcfc870b95a24c95521d1c14b2ef0c43ff45690abfb4231198034cd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BBABD5D_EC2D_4C5B_8F85_9C624B9FD8BB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A miniature railroad would be a better use of the space,⟪k:2⟫and certainly a great deal "
"easier on the eyes.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I could even get my hands on some genuine wheels."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아예 ⟪k:2⟫철도 모형을 전시하는 게 ⟪k:3⟫시원스럽겠군.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫차륜이라면 실물이 입수될 "
"수도 있겠어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5539370cb3c647abaf09edda183f5dbf26dc5bd7a79a2104c228964d49dfdc0c
#. default-sha256: 3f6d57902eb44a5d9f672c01e5123dc3f4b56034b2705b2f0c8267f143f88f70
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B207666D_936B_44C9_9C7C_CE9F92B6EFF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The same wheels being used on the revolutionary transcontinental railroad. ⟪k:1⟫Ten or "
"twenty years down the line, they’ll be worth a fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫기념비적인 대륙횡단철도 열차랑 ⟪k:1⟫똑같은 걸로.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫수십 년 후에는 높은 가치가 생길걸."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff2a7dea35f8fc6c59e3e498f9c28d520ea5773f95b6ddfca8d54773f8d8f45d
#. default-sha256: c0a154c9f236f9059b71af2ed71237083b9290f4869dd82266014097377c9481
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AFAEDCEF_79E1_4394_AD30_CF7351C71165"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……야코포……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 300c46c6342d65d43136c824ecde5cefed9727a639791a1e511e3cded7324d17
#. default-sha256: 563a84eaf19be8fcdd592c15ef2f27cb04f01bc3b8ac3de5e9dc1c736fd95490
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAE31A6D_DB82_4758_862E_40C74C135399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You know... ⟪k:2⟫how much this garden meant to me, don’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……제가…… ⟪k:2⟫이 정원을 ⟪k:3⟫소중히 가꾸던 건 ⟪k:4⟫알고 계시지요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a589f75f27c806ab75a861cc411878c43e80c5a94f2dd75c3d0cce760900dd81
#. default-sha256: 2bf0ea6aa3c4527027e168a28f339cf100e6c24c254ac3e7f2d794d415bcecc6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2646F604_F527_40E7_8C94_706205D6CCD2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: edf6ad85835020b4e5ffd11709398e1df4b3836989df2ef7095ef7a768e1be24
#. default-sha256: 531474ba24825273852d6c1179960a958a1ad9aa6324c9132c79958ed2b44c39
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38620622_641D_4020_97D5_437267C3BE03"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Did it honestly have no place here?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Flowers have a calming effect on people. "
"They give you peace."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫필요가 없으신가요……. ⟪k:2⟫꽃은 사람들의 마음을 진정시켜요. ⟪k:3⟫안식을 준단 말이에요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3c5e5cfe9c64a88ac8a4ea19409f6a2a2bf19853ee74b45991b6f8a74afb063
#. default-sha256: 47741c890477dd714a68e7c11b44b8643aa1806007b367d0855babbfe5873107
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ECB13A2E_A293_4572_871D_76EC1EEE57E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They are not, by any means, worthless—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫결코 ⟪k:1⟫쓸모없지는――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B898FD4B_CEAE_48CC_AEA1_1455042F2569
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 243267bcbdd286792c24cc6c8bda8243d99b3a25c31faf8e65204038d45715c7
#. default-sha256: c6d084db8312c6d4cdfc9e9cb2d64ac06915fcafdbfe8038382b5a2a7a5820bb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B898FD4B_CEAE_48CC_AEA1_1455042F2569"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So you’re saying that white rose was your passive-aggressive way of telling me to “calm "
"down”?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그럼 ⟪k:2⟫그 흰 장미는――, ⟪k:3⟫나더러 「진정하라」고 빈정거린 거였어?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_17B55CEE_966A_4E2A_A7B5_113B47328E10
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0cb450643d90a00949f9797f42b1ac890266172774678b36d6db7cbbabc0dcce
#. default-sha256: ceec44803f12e3d50d07e52b4b236611a7c36637183107dc4819e924f06d50eb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_17B55CEE_966A_4E2A_A7B5_113B47328E10"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫—! Not at all! I simply thought you—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………! ⟪k:2⟫아니에요, ⟪k:3⟫그건 ⟪k:4⟫여보를 생각해서――!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5B2DBEF9_7106_4D29_BF8C_F5C7BB17FF43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7614bd08ee567f1dd8edcb325d524a1d771a343c2810255ecfe0ec2791b5891
#. default-sha256: f18bd16ad83bb946f17d469a1ee46828483ffb04e583b803b777fae7354fac6e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5B2DBEF9_7106_4D29_BF8C_F5C7BB17FF43"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫At the end of the day, you’re just using them for your own purposes—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫to trick "
"and deceive."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫너도 어차피 ⟪k:2⟫꽃을 이용하는 것에 불과해.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫이런 걸 써서 ⟪k:5⟫남을 홀리려 하지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F751B1C5_87D9_495F_A07A_86AA8933AF31
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f13b245b49a9d33b420965fb5cd8c33657df7aa5d5920b8c8f819f383bbc2806
#. default-sha256: 152ce9a260822453ce54ac024cb3f68dbb7e455b5199d68418cfd497210bfa1a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F751B1C5_87D9_495F_A07A_86AA8933AF31"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To you, this rose garden was nothing but—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫너는 보나마나 ⟪k:1⟫이 장미 정원에서―――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_64914167_22B4_43EA_BF92_D7F19BC0D2AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36c8d4a9c8f052fd659325b4023cbcaa5d896a245be36a5cfc25f0a973462435
#. default-sha256: 48e5091748ec637f3e2dbe2acfb4bf8d43ed3b42763227b5ea706be42bf62f27
