msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Jacopo!⟪k:3⟫"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫야코포!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DB940F70_0A41_4EC9_82D3_2303EA61584C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1f923ec92340c9b23de51b6bdbb3a479395514ae22a564f87bfced7f061496a
#. default-sha256: dc3c1ac59ebfaa121d82cacc211049a8ccfac2fc0bb72b5ef66c2719daf31a88
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DB940F70_0A41_4EC9_82D3_2303EA61584C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’ve gone too far. This isn’t right..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……너, ⟪k:1⟫이건 심했어……. ⟪k:2⟫이런 짓을 하다니……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_25787A4E_DAFA_4523_8E06_C4EC856FE3DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91dcab2588b6c9ed849a2533906d91edc21a9031525fabbece727589c4bc9af8
#. default-sha256: cf43c8ff723920495abb34635bf1b8fc38be921885e5bf259023a39e45f55c89
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25787A4E_DAFA_4523_8E06_C4EC856FE3DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hmph. “Gone too far”? This is ⟪k:2⟫my⟪k:3⟫ mansion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫What I do with my property "
"is my business."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……흥, ⟪k:2⟫심하긴 무슨. ⟪k:3⟫애당초 ⟪k:4⟫이 저택은 내 소유야.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫자산을 어떻게 쓸"
"진 ⟪k:7⟫내 마음이지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E09D7B6B_CACA_41F8_B86C_8D1E053F40D3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a34dcbbff94fc7e120db17c46f1d8425b82a7406261ba17a1958addf148bcac
