msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B0D3046_CA98_404F_BFCC_3CD9980268FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93006ad353bea2ab67c933ce0f7ca22089f047d9f3ba0480ee3fd28628c80158
#. default-sha256: d0a0fd8cebaacbe6183948f3625f6fa4304744a7fc5366dc87faf52e7e68bfd5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B0D3046_CA98_404F_BFCC_3CD9980268FD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫With that rose arch out of the picture, we’ll have a much better view. ⟪k:2⟫There won’t "
"be anything blocking the sun any longer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫장미 아치가 사라지면 ⟪k:2⟫햇빛을 차단하는 것도 사라지는 셈이군.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫전망도 좋아지겠"
"어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BB050BA5_C3D2_4FF0_B282_9E74BDFFEFBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e026e4df3052e5c0e7b0d25dc92afe4d04430cd76105ac50278e03e7bd75ca9f
#. default-sha256: 30a76467b4fbe5d0221d50273de8d3b6b6c0da5418e51442d793dfab243f2582
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BB050BA5_C3D2_4FF0_B282_9E74BDFFEFBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Weren’t you supposed to be sensitive to sunlight?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Spend too much time out here "
"and you’re liable to fall ill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫너는 햇빛에 약하다지 않았어?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫여기 계속 있으면 ⟪k:4⟫몸에 해롭지?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CDAC70DC_BEF6_456F_97B2_F46E91647DC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: beb355277ed9641e511d46585cccb6a37316d01e24a68b2535e82bddb5c3bc8e
