#: scenario3:scenario3_1E66B0FF_6E8B_48DC_985D_4B40A76761DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8696ee37e6e11cbd83d0cacd21c9ffd2ba69b0fc2e84e581c2169a77e4ace1ce
